🚨 @RubinReport asks @GovRonDeSantis if he plans to run for President in 2028 👀

@GovRonDeSantis: Who knows what life will hold in the future. I have a lot of people that want me to do a lot of different things... If I do make next moves, I'll come on The Rubin Report to talk about it.

