🚨 @GovRonDeSantis on the ongoing exodus from blue states to Florida, and his push to eliminate property taxes.

@GovRonDeSantis: [Eliminating property tax] is the best thing we can do to help people on affordability... We can eliminate all homestead taxes, and we'd still have 35% more revenue than we had 7 years ago.

